WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.506
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:04.776 --> 00:05.819
Chiko.

3
00:08.113 --> 00:09.114
Chiko.

4
00:09.906 --> 00:11.199
Chiko.

5
00:12.993 --> 00:14.578
-Chiko... -[drunkard slurring]

6
00:14.661 --> 00:18.999
What's with you, grinning and going "Chiko" nonstop?

7
00:19.082 --> 00:21.752
Sorry. I'm going on a date with my girlfriend now.

8
00:21.835 --> 00:23.545
-[drunkard] What did you say? -[chuckles]

9
00:23.629 --> 00:25.797
[drunkard slurring]

10
00:26.381 --> 00:30.177
With all sorts of things happening in this world, young people should--

11
00:30.260 --> 00:32.888
Sorry, but I'm going on a date with my girlfriend.

12
00:32.971 --> 00:34.848
-Do it properly... -There, there.

13
00:34.931 --> 00:37.059
-Stop it. -Good boy.

14
00:37.142 --> 00:38.560
-I'll punch you in the face. -[chuckles]

15
00:38.644 --> 00:40.520
-[drunkard slurring] -Satoshi?

16
00:40.604 --> 00:42.064
Chiko!

17
00:45.776 --> 00:46.943
[laughs]

18
00:47.611 --> 00:49.529
-What's with your hair? -Huh?

19
00:50.656 --> 00:51.740
Is it that weird?

20
00:51.823 --> 00:53.658
[drunkard slurring]

21
00:55.744 --> 00:57.454
Why did you dye it like that?

22
00:57.954 --> 01:00.707
We'll look like a matching set. That's embarrassing.

23
01:00.791 --> 01:02.250
Huh?

24
01:02.334 --> 01:05.212
[Chiko] You bleached it, right? [laughs]

25
01:05.295 --> 01:07.339
I'm gonna change it back right now.

26
01:07.422 --> 01:08.757
[Chiko] No, you don't have to.

27
01:08.840 --> 01:12.052
No... Bleached blond hair isn't for me!

28
01:12.636 --> 01:13.637
I'm blond too.

29
01:13.720 --> 01:16.014
No. It suits you.

30
01:16.098 --> 01:17.557
I've decided to change it back.

31
01:17.641 --> 01:21.144
[sighs] Then I'll dye it for you. Let's go to Don Quijote.

32
01:22.479 --> 01:23.480
Huh?

33
01:24.648 --> 01:27.275
-Where will we do it? -Where else? At your place.

34
01:28.860 --> 01:30.028
[Chiko] What?

35
01:34.616 --> 01:36.535
-Is that not okay? -Not at all.

36
01:36.618 --> 01:38.370
You're very welcome!

37
01:39.871 --> 01:41.373
-Then let's go. -[snorts]

38
01:44.459 --> 01:48.088
Oh, that's right. Why don't you keep it as a memory?

39
01:49.172 --> 01:50.173
Your hair.

40
01:50.257 --> 01:52.592
[♪ light music playing]

41
01:58.765 --> 02:02.936
RED LIGHT ELEGY

42
02:04.521 --> 02:06.773
EPISODE 3

43
02:06.857 --> 02:07.858
[chuckles]

44
02:12.946 --> 02:14.573
[Satoshi groans] Oh, no.

45
02:17.868 --> 02:19.369
[Satoshi] You can come up now.

46
02:20.162 --> 02:21.163
[Chiko] Mm.

47
02:24.040 --> 02:25.709
[Satoshi] I live on the fourth floor.

48
02:26.418 --> 02:28.253
[Chiko] No elevator?

49
02:29.588 --> 02:31.590
[Satoshi] Uh... it's broken!

50
02:38.805 --> 02:40.724
Maybe we should leave it for a while.

51
02:40.807 --> 02:42.434
-Thanks. -Okay.

52
02:44.519 --> 02:46.521
-Can I smoke? -Sure.

53
02:46.605 --> 02:48.940
Ah, I'll get you something to drink.

54
02:49.024 --> 02:50.525
Do we even have an ashtray?

55
03:13.632 --> 03:15.175
[exclaims]

56
03:40.909 --> 03:42.911
[Satoshi yells] Damn! No!

57
03:42.994 --> 03:44.913
[spluttering] Well... this is... uh...

58
03:44.996 --> 03:47.082
These aren't actually mine!

59
03:47.165 --> 03:49.292
My friend brought me a ton of them.

60
03:49.376 --> 03:52.170
-And I... -Don't worry about it.

61
03:52.254 --> 03:53.672
No, but--

62
03:58.552 --> 04:00.220
Can I kiss you?

63
04:04.307 --> 04:05.684
I guess.

64
04:05.767 --> 04:08.103
[♪ soft music playing]

65
04:39.885 --> 04:42.888
Well, Chiko... can I touch your chest?

66
04:43.930 --> 04:45.682
[Chiko] Stop asking every little thing!

67
04:49.603 --> 04:51.229
-[door clanks] -[gasps]

68
04:51.688 --> 04:53.690
[Satoshi's brother] Huh? The door's unlocked.

69
04:54.900 --> 04:56.234
Bro, you home?

70
04:58.069 --> 04:59.487
Come on in.

71
05:00.363 --> 05:02.324
-[Sayaka] What should I do, Yak-kun? -[door closes]

72
05:02.407 --> 05:03.825
[Satoshi's brother] Just calm down!

73
05:04.367 --> 05:06.411
Bro, you back?

74
05:07.120 --> 05:08.330
Bro?

75
05:08.955 --> 05:10.874
-Bro? -[Satoshi] Come on...

76
05:13.335 --> 05:15.670
Whoa, Bro. What's with that hair?

77
05:16.129 --> 05:17.964
Didn't you say you were going out?

78
05:19.299 --> 05:20.342
Who's this?

79
05:20.842 --> 05:22.969
Uh... [awkward chuckle]

80
05:23.053 --> 05:26.097
Uh... this is my brother, Yasushi.

81
05:26.181 --> 05:28.683
And his girlfriend, Sayaka.

82
05:28.767 --> 05:30.310
And this is...

83
05:30.936 --> 05:32.938
my girlfriend, Chiko.

84
05:33.688 --> 05:36.524
What? Your girlfriend?

85
05:37.525 --> 05:39.027
-[Yasushi exclaims] -Hi.

86
05:39.110 --> 05:41.529
-[crying] -Come on...

87
05:41.613 --> 05:43.156
Sayaka, I told you not to cry.

88
05:43.239 --> 05:44.991
[crying continues]

89
05:47.869 --> 05:49.079
This one is...

90
05:49.162 --> 05:52.332
Preg... pregnancy, pregnancy...

91
05:55.502 --> 05:57.253
Let's do the test first.

92
05:58.630 --> 06:00.215
To the bathroom. Can you stand?

93
06:00.298 --> 06:02.467
[water flushing]

94
06:03.969 --> 06:05.887
[sobbing]

95
06:07.097 --> 06:08.431
I...

96
06:09.140 --> 06:11.101
I can't kill this baby.

97
06:11.184 --> 06:14.646
But... we're both in high school.

98
06:14.729 --> 06:16.106
How can we raise a kid?

99
06:16.189 --> 06:18.441
How am I supposed to know?

100
06:18.525 --> 06:20.068
So I said it's impossible!

101
06:20.151 --> 06:22.320
What choice do we have? Listen...

102
06:22.404 --> 06:24.406
Calm down, Sayaka!

103
06:24.489 --> 06:25.573
We can't make it.

104
06:25.657 --> 06:26.783
[Yasushi grunts]

105
06:28.159 --> 06:30.120
-[groans] -[Sayaka] Yak-kun?

106
06:30.203 --> 06:34.541
If you're freaking out this much, you shouldn't have slept together.

107
06:35.458 --> 06:36.459
[Yasushi groaning]

108
06:37.127 --> 06:38.670
You need to see a doctor too.

109
06:39.796 --> 06:42.257
[Chiko] Just calm down and talk it out.

110
06:43.508 --> 06:45.176
[engine idling]

111
06:51.099 --> 06:52.183
Oh.

112
06:56.896 --> 06:57.939
Whatever.

113
07:08.867 --> 07:10.910
I want to have Yak-kun's baby.

114
07:11.661 --> 07:13.371
I'm not going home.

115
07:17.459 --> 07:20.253
[mom] What do you think, Yasushi?

116
07:22.130 --> 07:25.675
For me... If that's what Sayaka wants...

117
07:29.345 --> 07:30.638
Do whatever you want.

118
07:34.225 --> 07:37.437
You can't live without money. So get a job right away.

119
07:39.355 --> 07:41.691
I'm not taking responsibility.

120
07:44.319 --> 07:47.405
Mom! They're still in high school.

121
07:47.489 --> 07:49.115
You have to help them a little.

122
07:49.199 --> 07:51.701
[mom] We can't afford any more mouths to feed.

123
07:52.702 --> 07:54.496
We can't do that.

124
07:57.248 --> 07:58.708
Your dad...

125
07:58.792 --> 08:03.546
worked like a horse for you all and died.

126
08:12.597 --> 08:16.267
-Then I'll move out! -What?

127
08:21.314 --> 08:22.941
Do whatever you want.

128
08:24.025 --> 08:27.153
[rental agent] Mr. Yanagawa, you work for a security company?

129
08:27.237 --> 08:29.906
-Yes. -[rental agent] I see. And...

130
08:29.989 --> 08:31.741
-A part-time job? -Yes.

131
08:32.325 --> 08:35.328
Part-time. Hmm... Part-time.

132
08:36.913 --> 08:38.665
Part-time...

133
08:39.332 --> 08:42.377
[Chiko] Part-timers and full-timers rent places too!

134
08:42.460 --> 08:45.630
You've got a guarantor. Who do you think you are, old man?

135
08:45.713 --> 08:49.217
Is that how you ask to rent someone's property?

136
08:49.300 --> 08:55.140
Besides, no one rents to people like you who don't even work properly!

137
08:55.223 --> 08:57.142
I work my ass off!

138
08:57.225 --> 09:00.520
That's why I'm here trying to rent a place, dumbass!

139
09:00.603 --> 09:02.647
-You don't look employed to me! -Stop!

140
09:02.730 --> 09:06.776
-What part of us looks unemployed, huh? -Chiko, stop! Thanks!

141
09:06.860 --> 09:08.319
I can tell from head to toe.

142
09:08.403 --> 09:11.489
How about you? Look in the mirror, asshole!

143
09:13.616 --> 09:15.994
Unload everything first, then sort it later.

144
09:16.077 --> 09:17.078
[Satoshi] Okay.

145
09:19.205 --> 09:20.290
[Satoshi groans]

146
09:39.684 --> 09:41.019
It's hot.

147
09:45.565 --> 09:48.693
Whew... [groans]

148
09:48.776 --> 09:51.112
-[Chiko] Let's get the next one. -Sure.

149
09:57.660 --> 10:01.331
Wait... are you moving into the unit upstairs?

150
10:01.414 --> 10:04.000
[Satoshi] Yes. I'm Yanagawa.

151
10:04.083 --> 10:06.920
-Hello. Nice to meet you. -[Satoshi] Hello.

152
10:07.003 --> 10:10.757
-I'm Kiyobayashi, the manager. [chuckles] -[Satoshi] I see.

153
10:10.840 --> 10:12.175
You two live together?

154
10:12.258 --> 10:14.260
-[Chiko] No. -[Satoshi] No. Just me.

155
10:14.344 --> 10:16.304
-Really? -[Satoshi] Yes.

156
10:17.263 --> 10:19.182
But you're a couple, right?

157
10:19.265 --> 10:20.558
[Satoshi] Well... yes.

158
10:20.642 --> 10:23.686
Burnables are collected Mondays and Fridays.

159
10:23.770 --> 10:26.272
Just put your trash out between 6:30 and 7:30 a.m.

160
10:26.356 --> 10:28.608
No putting it out the night before.

161
10:28.691 --> 10:32.278
If you miss the deadline, you'll have to take it back inside.

162
10:32.362 --> 10:34.530
-I see. -There's a couple in Room 201,

163
10:34.614 --> 10:38.284
-named Yamashita and Mukai. -[awkward chuckle]

164
10:38.368 --> 10:40.328
They're always late with the trash.

165
10:40.411 --> 10:43.456
They say Yamashita gets home late, but--

166
10:43.539 --> 10:46.042
Sorry, ma'am. We've still got boxes to move.

167
10:46.125 --> 10:51.130
[laughs] Sorry, I got carried away. Sorry, sorry.

168
10:56.552 --> 11:01.641
Ah, and one thing, laundry disturbs the neighbors.

169
11:01.724 --> 11:03.184
Don't do that after 8:00 p.m.

170
11:03.768 --> 11:05.645
-Okay. -I'm counting on you.

171
11:16.197 --> 11:21.202
[chuckles] That's Mom for you. They sell this at any supermarket.

172
11:22.161 --> 11:23.538
[Chiko] True.

173
11:28.167 --> 11:31.045
TO SATOSHI

174
11:43.141 --> 11:45.143
I need a washing machine too.

175
11:45.226 --> 11:47.937
[Chiko] 8:00 p.m. is way too early for laundry.

176
11:48.021 --> 11:49.147
[soft chuckle]

177
11:49.230 --> 11:51.899
-I know a cheap place. Let's go buy one. -Okay.

178
11:56.946 --> 11:59.449
There's a room for your stuff too.

179
12:01.117 --> 12:02.285
Huh?

180
12:08.458 --> 12:09.500
Well...

181
12:10.752 --> 12:14.881
I might move in someday if I feel like it.

182
12:15.798 --> 12:16.799
What?

183
12:18.176 --> 12:20.970
Right, there's somewhere I wanna go. Just come with me.

184
12:21.554 --> 12:22.555
Huh?

185
12:28.936 --> 12:32.023
ONION TEMPURA

186
12:32.815 --> 12:34.650
Let's grab some yakitori too.

187
12:48.706 --> 12:50.291
It was full of old guys.

188
12:50.375 --> 12:53.002
Give us 20 years, and we'll be the same.

189
12:53.086 --> 12:54.754
[chuckles]

190
12:55.797 --> 12:57.548
TAMADE SUPERMARKET

191
13:02.553 --> 13:04.597
-Chiko! -Huh?

192
13:06.599 --> 13:07.934
Chiko...

193
13:08.017 --> 13:10.353
Why don't we live here together?

194
13:17.944 --> 13:20.613
No, that's not it.

195
13:20.696 --> 13:24.617
The landlord gave me two keys, so I just thought I'd give you one.

196
13:25.618 --> 13:26.828
And...

197
13:26.911 --> 13:28.663
That's all. [awkward chuckle]

198
13:47.140 --> 13:48.432
[soft groan]

199
13:51.727 --> 13:54.230
[soft moaning]

200
13:56.941 --> 13:58.693
[exhales] Chiko...

201
14:00.111 --> 14:03.531
What am I gonna do without you?

202
14:08.161 --> 14:09.745
[Satoshi snoring]

203
14:48.201 --> 14:51.245
Seriously, knock it off. I told you to stop!

204
14:51.329 --> 14:52.538
[cans clattering]

205
14:54.665 --> 14:56.667
It's my money. What's wrong with that?

206
14:56.751 --> 14:59.879
-Let go of me. -You're such a pain, damn it!

207
14:59.962 --> 15:00.963
[groans]

208
15:04.217 --> 15:05.843
Get the hell out of here!

209
15:05.927 --> 15:07.929
[♪ somber music playing]

210
15:09.931 --> 15:10.932
[tuts]

211
15:27.615 --> 15:29.200
Yu... Yusaku...

212
15:44.048 --> 15:45.466
Hmm?

213
15:46.050 --> 15:48.052
[♪ somber music continues]

214
16:06.153 --> 16:07.238
[Chiko sniffles]

215
16:11.117 --> 16:13.119
[Satoshi snoring]

216
16:15.288 --> 16:17.123
[birds chirping]

217
16:18.165 --> 16:19.292
[sharp inhale]

218
16:45.526 --> 16:46.652
[both] What?

219
16:47.570 --> 16:51.490
No way. You've got a... girlfriend?

220
16:52.825 --> 16:55.411
Well, yeah. A girlfriend.

221
16:55.953 --> 16:58.456
[friend 1] Where? Where did you meet her?

222
16:59.749 --> 17:01.125
At work, kind of.

223
17:01.208 --> 17:03.878
[friend 1] No way you can get a girlfriend as a security guard.

224
17:03.961 --> 17:06.422
Bet she's just plain and boring like you.

225
17:06.505 --> 17:08.424
Yeah, absolutely.

226
17:08.507 --> 17:10.343
Your prejudice is insane.

227
17:10.426 --> 17:15.056
Actually, Chiko is beautiful, strong, and a little too gorgeous.

228
17:15.139 --> 17:18.559
Beautiful? Why would a girl like that date a guy like you?

229
17:18.642 --> 17:20.353
Yeah, that's true.

230
17:20.436 --> 17:24.231
You're so plain, spineless, and still a virgin.

231
17:26.609 --> 17:29.111
[seller] Satoshi, your fries are ready. Come get them.

232
17:29.195 --> 17:31.947
-I'm busy! -Coming. [chuckles]

233
17:35.117 --> 17:37.620
-[friend 1] What's with him? -[kid 1] The Lost Gen is over, right?

234
17:37.703 --> 17:39.789
-[kid 2] What's that? -[friend 2] No way. Why him?

235
17:39.872 --> 17:41.123
[kid 1] The generation with all the bad luck.

236
17:41.207 --> 17:44.293
[friend 2] Why does it have to be him?

237
17:44.377 --> 17:46.253
Hey, Shige. Check her out!

238
17:47.380 --> 17:50.675
[Shige] What's with her? She looks creepy.

239
17:50.758 --> 17:52.426
[friend 1] But she's really cute.

240
17:52.510 --> 17:54.470
[Shige] Yeah, you're right.

241
17:54.553 --> 17:56.806
-She's cute. -Cute.

242
17:56.889 --> 17:58.099
Huh?

243
17:58.724 --> 17:59.809
-What? -What?

244
18:00.393 --> 18:03.270
-[friend 1] Is she staring at us? -[Shige] She is.

245
18:03.354 --> 18:04.355
She's coming over.

246
18:04.438 --> 18:05.773
-Is she? Why? -Yeah.

247
18:05.856 --> 18:07.358
[friend 1] Dunno, but here she comes.

248
18:08.025 --> 18:09.944
[♪ quirky music playing]

249
18:15.491 --> 18:16.534
Hey.

250
18:19.704 --> 18:20.871
-[chair clanks] -Hey.

251
18:23.082 --> 18:24.291
-[loudly] Hey. -[gasps]

252
18:26.252 --> 18:28.003
[Chiko] What are you looking at?

253
18:28.087 --> 18:30.881
-Well... Nothing... -Right.

254
18:30.965 --> 18:32.717
-Just nothing. -No looking.

255
18:32.800 --> 18:33.884
[Chiko tuts]

256
18:36.887 --> 18:39.348
Oh... Chiko!

257
18:39.432 --> 18:40.975
Satoshi.

258
18:41.058 --> 18:42.184
[friends] What?

259
18:43.686 --> 18:45.187
I didn't mean it.

260
18:45.896 --> 18:48.649
[Chiko] I was just pissed off after a fight with my mom.

261
18:49.191 --> 18:51.277
-I got it. -I'm sorry.

262
18:53.571 --> 18:55.823
Something came up. I need to go.

263
18:55.906 --> 18:57.867
Oh, really?

264
18:58.492 --> 19:02.788
Well... I just wanted you to meet these two.

265
19:03.539 --> 19:06.125
[slurping]

266
19:07.418 --> 19:08.627
-See ya. -Yeah.

267
19:10.880 --> 19:13.883
[footsteps receding]

268
19:21.932 --> 19:23.517
[camera shutter clicking]

269
19:24.935 --> 19:26.437
What are you doing?

270
19:28.731 --> 19:32.359
-Are you sure she isn't a scammer? -What?

271
19:32.443 --> 19:34.612
If you touch her, will you end up working

272
19:34.695 --> 19:36.906
in some remote mine until you die?

273
19:36.989 --> 19:40.284
Stop talking about Chiko like she's some human trafficker!

274
19:40.367 --> 19:41.535
So...

275
19:42.369 --> 19:45.080
have you slept with her--

276
19:45.164 --> 19:46.165
[yelps]

277
19:47.458 --> 19:49.293
-[awkward chuckle] -[Shige] My goodness.

278
19:49.376 --> 19:51.879
No, not yet.

279
19:52.797 --> 19:55.299
She's never stayed over at my place.

280
19:55.382 --> 19:57.218
-[friend 1] Even though you're dating? -Yeah.

281
19:57.301 --> 20:00.262
[friend 1] You sure she's not hiding something?

282
20:00.346 --> 20:01.764
Of course not.

283
20:06.477 --> 20:08.020
I've gotta get to work.

284
20:08.687 --> 20:10.272
See ya.

285
20:10.356 --> 20:12.233
-[Shige] Sure. -Good luck, boy.

286
20:12.316 --> 20:14.401
-Okay. -[Satoshi laughs]

287
20:18.697 --> 20:21.700
5,000 yen says they break up within a month.

288
20:21.784 --> 20:23.953
10,000 yen says they don't last two weeks.

289
20:37.758 --> 20:40.010
Hey, Chiko. Good to see you.

290
20:40.094 --> 20:41.846
Hey.

291
20:41.929 --> 20:42.930
Why did you come?

292
20:44.056 --> 20:45.182
Because you called me.

293
20:45.266 --> 20:46.267
Right!

294
20:46.350 --> 20:49.270
Um... only you can do this.

295
20:50.396 --> 20:52.147
-Should be fine. -Hmm?

296
20:59.530 --> 21:02.283
A mobile suit made just for you.

297
21:03.701 --> 21:04.827
Hmm?

298
21:05.953 --> 21:08.414
[Inaba] Here. Red bean rice.

299
21:08.497 --> 21:10.082
-Go. -Huh?

300
21:10.165 --> 21:12.793
Thought your big day might be soon.

301
21:12.877 --> 21:15.170
Mr. Inaba, this is too much.

302
21:15.254 --> 21:18.090
Let's make today the anniversary of losing your virginity.

303
21:18.173 --> 21:22.177
I know that you've been holding it in for so long.

304
21:23.012 --> 21:24.054
Just eat.

305
21:25.598 --> 21:26.640
[phone chimes]

306
21:30.895 --> 21:32.229
[CHIKO] CAN I COME OVER TODAY?

307
21:32.313 --> 21:33.647
-[Inaba] Who? -From Chiko.

308
21:33.731 --> 21:36.025
-What did she say? -"Can I come over today?"

309
21:36.650 --> 21:37.902
Way to go.

310
21:38.903 --> 21:41.280
-You're a prophet. -[laughs]

311
21:42.364 --> 21:44.700
[♪ soft music playing]

312
22:21.445 --> 22:23.197
[screaming]

313
22:23.280 --> 22:25.032
[laughing]

314
22:25.574 --> 22:27.451
Tissues! Tissues!

315
22:27.534 --> 22:29.703
How many did you use?

316
22:29.787 --> 22:31.121
-I'm dying. -Sorry.

317
22:31.205 --> 22:33.332
No! Anything but that.

318
22:35.376 --> 22:38.253
[Chiko] I'm thinking of working at a snack bar

319
22:38.337 --> 22:40.839
until a delivery company hires me.

320
22:42.007 --> 22:43.968
Hiro got me a job.

321
22:44.760 --> 22:46.261
A snack bar?

322
22:46.971 --> 22:51.266
I'm not sure about that.

323
22:55.562 --> 22:59.233
Looks like we're gonna need money for all sorts of things.

324
23:01.735 --> 23:02.987
[exclaims]

325
23:03.070 --> 23:04.238
Oh, right.

326
23:05.948 --> 23:07.950
Here, I'll return this.

327
23:08.409 --> 23:10.411
[shocked gasp]

328
23:11.412 --> 23:12.788
Are you kidding?

329
23:13.372 --> 23:15.207
[exclaims excitedly]

330
23:15.749 --> 23:16.750
Wanna go somewhere?

331
23:16.834 --> 23:18.711
This room is dull. Maybe a hotel--

332
23:18.794 --> 23:20.587
Way too fast!

333
23:20.671 --> 23:22.172
That's not what I meant.

334
23:23.757 --> 23:25.926
[Chiko] But let's make it, to a hotel!

335
23:26.593 --> 23:27.678
[Satoshi] Yes, sir!

336
23:27.761 --> 23:29.096
[footsteps]

337
23:46.113 --> 23:51.035
[OSAKA'S TOP FOOD PICK] TAMADE SUPERMARKET'S PREPARED DISHES

338
23:51.118 --> 23:53.203
[Chiko] Anything else you want?

339
23:54.121 --> 23:56.040
[Satoshi] Mm...

340
23:56.123 --> 23:58.584
No, that might be all right.

341
24:01.378 --> 24:02.880
[Chiko] Let's go then.

342
24:02.963 --> 24:05.382
[♪ closing theme music playing]
